# == Jetpack environment model (PortEnvModel) ==
# The jet-env-model `evaluate_env` graph behind `jet inspect env` and every
# command that resolves a typed environment, referenced from Jetpack/EnvModel,
# never copied (I8). It builds on the package-model block above and adds the
# package-model files the evaluator needs (platform key, merge law, recipe
# steps, provider facts). Activation-only readers that need the package
# resolver (Environment/DotenvAuthority, Workspace/WorkspaceFile) and the
# bounded JSON decode (Provider/ProviderFactsJson) stay in Jetpack's own
# build until D-FSDIR1 (#4697) / D-CORE-JSONLIMIT1.
Jetpack/PackageModel/Source/Platform/Platform.jet
Jetpack/PackageModel/Source/Merge/FactLaw.jet
Jetpack/PackageModel/Source/Merge/Merge.jet
Jetpack/PackageModel/Source/Recipe/BuildRecipe.jet
Jetpack/PackageModel/Source/Provider/ProviderSelector.jet
Jetpack/PackageModel/Source/Provider/ProviderFacts.jet
Jetpack/EnvModel/Source/Environment/FactReaders.jet
Jetpack/EnvModel/Source/Environment/Integrations.jet
Jetpack/EnvModel/Source/Environment/ManagedFiles.jet
Jetpack/EnvModel/Source/Environment/Presets.jet
Jetpack/EnvModel/Source/Environment/PackageProfiles.jet
